  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Bike to the Beach | Surrounded By Nature | 3,200 Sq Ft<br><br>Make your escape to sun and surf — this Santa Rosa Beach vacation rental is your ticket to Gulf bliss! Enjoy effortless days lounging on sugar-white sand and exploring local beachfront bars, then gather you crew back at the 5-bed, 3.5-bath house to soak in the hot tub, dine out under the Florida breeze, or host a backyard bonfire. Get ready to discover the unbeatable blend of privacy and play that makes this home a sun-chaser's paradise.<br><br>-- THE PROPERTY --<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br>- Bedroom 1: 1 king bed<br>- Bedroom 2: 1 king bed<br>- Bedroom 3: 1 queen bed<br>- Bedroom 4: 2 twin bunk beds<br>- Bedroom 5 (Bunkhouse): 1 king bed, 1 twin bunk bed<br><br>INDOOR LIVING<br>- Smart TV in each bedroom<br>- Dining table, kitchen island seating<br>- Sunroom w/ floor-to-ceiling windows<br>- Bunkhouse w/ kitchenette<br>- Soaking tub, washer & dryer, hangers<br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING<br>- Private pool (unheated), hot tub<br>- Beach toys, bikes<br>- Screened-in porch, lounge seating<br>- Backyard, fire pit, outdoor dining set<br><br>KITCHEN<br>- Dishwasher, refrigerator, stove/oven, microwave<br>- Drip/pod coffee maker<br>- Cooking basics, dishware & flatware, trash bags & paper towels<br><br>GENERAL<br>- Central heating & A/C<br>- Towels & linens, complimentary toiletries, hair dryer<br>- Free WiFi<br>- Keyless entry<br><br>FAQ<br>- 2 exterior security cameras (facing out)<br>- Quiet hours (10:00 PM-6:00 AM)<br>- Fireplace (decorative only)<br><br>ACCESSIBILITY<br>- 2-story home, 1 step to enter<br>- Bedroom & bathroom on 1st floor<br>- Stairs to access bunkhouse<br><br>PARKING<br>- Driveway (3 vehicles)<br>- No street parking<br><br>-- THE LOCATION --<br><br>- 0.7 miles to public beach access<br>- 1 mile to local cafes, bars, restaurants & entertainment on 30A<br>- 3 miles to Grayton Beach State Park<br>- 10 miles to Camp Helen State Park<br>- 44 miles to Destin-Fort Walton Beach Airport<br><br>-- REST EASY WITH US --<br><br>Evolve makes it easy to find and book properties you’ll never want to leave. You can relax knowing that our properties will always be ready for you and that we’ll answer the phone 24/7. Even better, if anything is off about your stay, we’ll make it right. You can count on our homes and our people to make you feel welcome — because we know what vacation means to you.<br><br>-- POLICIES --<br><br>- No smoking<br>- No pets allowed<br>- No events, parties, or large gatherings<br>- Additional fees and taxes may apply<br>- Photo ID may be required upon check-in<br>- Please observe quiet hours from 10:00 PM to 6:00 AM<br><br>ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<br>- This 2-story home requires 1 step to enter, with a bedroom and bathroom on the 1st floor. The bunkhouse requires stairs to access<br>- The fireplace is not available for guest use<br>- Your safety matters. This property features 2 exterior security cameras. Camera 1 is on the front door facing the front walkway, and camera 2 is on the back door facing the backyard. The cameras are outward facing and do not look into interior spaces. The cameras record video and sound when activated by motion",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Luxe 30A Group Getaway! Home w/ Pool & Patio"
        }
      ],
